<title>UK: Associates corp prices $500 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Associates corp prices $500 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and J.P Morgan, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASSOCIATES CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    11.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.271   PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.621    SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING  LON/HK/SING PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC   1.65</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
